---
const columns = [
  {
    title: "产品",
    links: [
      { label: "AI工具榜", href: "/tools" },
      { label: "AI趋势词榜单", href: "/trends" },
      { label: "提交产品", href: "/#submit" },
      { label: "Changelog", href: "#" },
    ],
  },
  {
    title: "公司",
    links: [
      { label: "关于我们", href: "#" },
      { label: "联系我们", href: "#" },
      { label: "加入我们", href: "#" },
    ],
  },
  {
    title: "支持",
    links: [
      { label: "常见问题", href: "/#faq" },
      { label: "数据来源", href: "/#sources" },
      { label: "反馈与勘误", href: "#" },
    ],
  },
];

const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-border bg-surface/40">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6">
    <div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-4">
      <div class="md:col-span-1">
        <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2" aria-label="Horizons.tools 首页">
          <img src="/brand/mark.png" alt="" width="239" height="112" class="h-7 w-auto" />
          <span class="text-base font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">Horizons<span class="text-ink-muted">.tools</span></span>
        </a>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">
          看见下一个市场机会。用可追溯的信号，追踪值得关注的 AI 工具。
        </p>
      </div>

      {columns.map((col) => (
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink">{col.title}</h3>
          <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2.5">
            {col.links.map((l) => (
              <li>
                <a href={l.href} class="text-sm text-ink-muted transition hover:text-ink">
                  {l.label}
                </a>
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 border-t border-border pt-6">
      <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">
        © {year} Horizons · 数据来自公开官方接口与人工整理，热度为可追溯指标，不代表真实访问量。仅供研究参考。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>